  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Offentlig finansiell styrning - FINMAP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till reform av offentlig finansiell styrning i Uganda. Sverige bidrar genom en s k basket fund tillsammans med sex andra givare. Ett s k Memoramdum of Understanding har uppr&#xe4;ttats mellan givare och den ugandiska regeringen. Programmet har sex komponenter som inkluderar institutioner p&#xe5; b&#xe5;de central och lokal niv&#xe5; t ex Finansministeriet, Riksrevisionen och parlamentet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to public financial management reform in Uganda. Sweden contributes to a basket fund together with six other donors. There is a Memorandum of Understanding between partners and government. The programme has six components spanning central and local government institutions, including the Ministry of Finance, the Accountant General and the Auditor General&apos;s office, as well as Parliament.</narrative>
  </description>
